EmailTemplate.textOnly:
To {!advpm__Matter__c.advpm__Primary_Contact__c},

Even though the offer for the significantly reduced settlement has expired, at this time we are able to offer a monthly payment plan on the amount due on your loan.

Twelve (12) monthly payments of $ [CHARGEOFF DIVIDED BY 12].  If you wish to take advantage of this payment plan, please reach out to us to set up.

If you are unable make the above monthly payments, but still want to come to an agreement prior to incurring additional fees through litigation, please let us know as soon as possible.

If we are unable to come to a payment agreement, then we will be moving forward with filing a law suit for the full amount due on the loan.

We hope to hear from you soon.


Sincerely,


{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

{!advpm__Matter__c.Email_Signature_Company__c}

